 Unicode character data (scoped dependency exception)
 ----------------------------------------------------
 
 The transitive dependency unicode-ident 1.0.27 declares
 (MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND Unicode-3.0. Its character-property data adds the
 Unicode-3.0 requirement. The user approved this Unicode-table-only exception
 on 2026-11-06. deny.toml restricts it to unicode-ident =1.0.27; it does not
 allow Unicode-3.0 for other crates or versions. The library itself remains MIT.
